{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{ShepherdGreen} 三十七站 \textperiodcentered\ 九卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一條神與人同住的線}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{ChapterRoyal}\kaiti\selectfont
「道成了肉身，住在我們中間，充充滿滿地有恩典有真理。我們也見過他的榮光，正是父獨生子的榮光。」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“And the Word became flesh, and dwelt among us, and we saw His glory, glory as of the only begotten from the Father, full of grace and truth.”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{ChapterRoyal} 約翰福音 1:14 \textperiodcentered\ John 1:14}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
